'''Small lizards''' are [[Slayer monsters]] found north-north-east of [[Nardah]] east of [[Fairy rings|fairy ring]] {{Fairycode|DLQ}}. An [[ice cooler]] must be used on a lizard when it has 1-4 Hitpoints left in order to kill it. They can be killed for [[lizard]] [[Slayer task]]s.

Players can kill [[Sulphur Lizard|sulphur]] or [[Grimy Lizard|grimy lizards]] as an alternative to desert lizards, provided they have 44 Slayer. Additionally, these types of lizards do not require [[ice cooler]]s to finish off.

